OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 101, gets Ohio birthday
OL,4,Acard in mayoral mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unexpected card from a mayor in
OL,7,FAmerica was among hundreds of wishes
OL,8,Fsent to a care home resident for her
OL,9,F101st birthday.
OL,11,FJoan Hillman, resident of Hartwood
OL,12,FHouse in the New Forest, said she felt
OL,13,F"very lucky" to have received the
OL,14,Fcards, which were collected by the care
OL,15,Fhome.
OL,17,FAmong the cards was a transatlantic
OL,18,Fgreeting from the mayor of Lyndhurst in
OL,19,FOhio after the care home accidentally
OL,20,Fcontacted him instead of the mayor of
OL,21,FLyndhurst in Hampshire.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
