OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 101, gets Ohio birthday
OL,4,Acard in mayoral mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlotte Dean of the care home said
OL,7,Fthe initiative "brought together
OL,8,Fgenerations, organisations and
OL,9,Fcommunities from both sides of the
OL,10,FAtlantic, all united by the desire to
OL,11,Fmake one remarkable lady feel loved and
OL,12,Fcelebrated".
